====Trivia====
This is one of the longest English words that can have one letter taken away at a time and still be a common word, down to one letter: {{term|startling}}, {{term|starting}} or {{term|starling}}, {{term|staring}}, {{term|string}}, {{term|sting}}, {{term|sing}}, {{term|sin}}, {{term|in}}, and {{term|I}}. {{term|sparkling}} and {{term|splashing}} also bear this property.

